Subject: new RPC method ps5_files

The read-only file picker of the web interface: {} returns the connected disks, { path } the subfolders and the
*.torrent files of a folder. The listing logic is the shared picker core (src/common/fs_list.cc and
src/daemon/fs_picker.cc); this patch only calls it and parses the JSON into the RPC answer.

---
--- a/libtransmission/rpcimpl.cc
